    "intro": "The **Tattoo Shop Name Generator** suggests names for a tattoo shop, tattoo studio or parlour (parlor in the US): catchy, funny, cute and fine line, traditional, cool, modern, your town or your own name.",
    "sections": [],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a tattoo shop name is free?",
        "answer": "Press Check on any name to see whether it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. In the UK, also search Companies House; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. Check your local area too, as another business nearby with a similar name can confuse clients."
      },
      {
        "question": "What are good tattoo shop names with meaning?",
        "answer": "Traditional tattoo symbols make names with a story: an anchor stands for steadiness, a swallow for coming home safely, a rose for love, a compass or lighthouse for finding your way, and a horseshoe for luck. Pair two (\"Anchor & Swallow Tattoo\") or add your street or town. Keep it easy to say and spell, and check no other studio nearby uses something similar."
      }
    ]
